('127.252.d.8.E',5,'A statement shows an ending balance of $1,240. Your register shows $1,010 after subtracting a $230 check that has not cleared. What does the register balance mean after reconciling?','["The bank made a $230 error", "The register is wrong by $230", "The account is overdrawn", "The two balances agree once the outstanding check is accounted for"]'::jsonb,3,'1,240 - 230 = 1,010, so they match.','original')
